    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d153">

                <pb facs="0277" n="165" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg165"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1972</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-24T15:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 24, 1918, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your August 22, 6 p.m. Should an authentic copy of the texts of the agreement and
                    exchange of notes relating to a loan on the security of the forests and mines in
                    Kirin and Heilungkiang Provinces confirm substantially the texts forwarded with
                    your despatch of July 27 last you will lodge with the Chinese Government a
                    formal protest against the monopolistic features of the said agreement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
